# Bulk scene replacement in a single round trip: optionally clear the
# current object set, then add every listed object, then refresh the solver
# worlds ONCE (instead of once per add_object, which re-runs scene
# normalization plus the motion/IK/FK checker refreshes under the GPU lock
# for every single obstacle — the dominant cost of replaying benchmark
# problems through the server).
#
# Fails fast with success=false WITHOUT mutating the scene when any entry
# is invalid (bad dimensions, duplicate name, unusable mesh spec); the
# already-registered scene is left exactly as it was.
SceneObject[] objects
bool clear_first true
---
# Response fields
bool success
string message
